  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A formation grandmaster asks for five hundred kilograms of rank eight immortal material heavy sand to temporarily cover a shortage in a formation core. Heavy sand is a specialty product of Western Desert and is not produced in the other four regions. Heavenly Court storage can supply it, but at least two hundred and fifty kilograms must be poured from top to bottom in spectral heaven while people inside the formation cooperate to fill the hole.",
